James Rising reached out to Jong-Kai regarding a virus found in a server that Jong-Kai had previously worked on. Jong-Kai responded, expressing gratitude for the past experience at the Climate Impact Lab and clarifying that he hadn’t logged into the server since his departure. He shared updates about his life and projects, including building HackMD, and offered to give back in any way possible. In James’ email response, he acknowledged Jong-Kai’s accomplishments and reassured him that the virus did not cause significant damage, wishing him and his family well.
